+      "encoding": "utf-8",
+      "content": "# Subagent Review Checklist\n\n## Scope\n\n- Parent task:\n- Subagent task:\n- Owner:\n- scope_write:\n- scope_read:\n- must_not_touch:\n\n## Completion Review\n\n| Check | Result | Evidence |\n|---|---|---|\n| Scope stayed inside `scope_write` | pass |  |\n| No shared contract/schema/root config changed unexpectedly | pass |  |\n| Verification commands ran | pass |  |\n| Handoff summary is clear | pass |  |\n| Integration risk identified | pass |  |\n\n## Rework Decision\n\n- Accept as-is:\n- Needs integration fix:\n- Needs subagent follow-up:\n- Collapse to main-thread integration:\n\n## Final Integration\n\n- Merge order:\n- Integration command:\n- Evidence path:\n"
